      "widgets_values": [
        "**EVE Tools for ComfyUI: shot (first + last frame)**\n\nLTX-2.5 distilled. *First frame* and *Last frame* are the stills at the start and the end of the camera move; `LTXVAddGuide` pins them at frame 0 and -1. 24 fps, 97 frames, with audio.\n\nModels: `scripts/models.md` in the repo."
      ],
